{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Words fade, but traces on paper remain forever.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uses minimalist click-based interactions to immerse players in the nuanced inner world of a selectively mute protagonist. There are no lengthy dialogues \u2013 only the subtle sounds of stickers being placed, shifting light patterns in the environment, and the growing resolve reflected in the girl's receding silhouette. This is a journey exploring silence, solitude, and courage; a wordless conversation that transcends time to become an act of healing. What ultimately takes shape isn't a perfect scrapbook, but rather a catharsis that leads toward tomorrow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Piece together your own story.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/4\u670822\u65e5__1__2_.gif?t=1745549439\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Search for puzzle fragments across different worlds.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/4\u670822\u65e5__1_.gif?t=1745549439\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/4\u670822\u65e5__1__1_.gif?t=1745549439\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656760?t=1745549439","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656760?t=1745549439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/6711bdc5ee9e5b380e3f3ccf1963c58c7c7a9110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745549439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/6711bdc5ee9e5b380e3f3ccf1963c58c7c7a9110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745549439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"d